      "releaseNotes": "• Improved performance for RPG Maker XP, VX, and VX Ace, with smoother gameplay and fewer stalls on large maps, during battles, and in menus\n• Reduced memory usage during extended play sessions, especially in text-heavy games\n• Fixed a crash that could occur when the first message box appeared in some fan-made games\n• General compatibility and stability improvements across supported RPG Maker engines",
